flowchart LR
    EV[Domain event] --> ING[Ingest topic]
    ING --> FAN[Fan-out workers - paginated]
    FAN --> PREF[Preferences + quiet hours]
    PREF --> DED[Dedup event × user × channel]
    DED --> QP[Priority queues]
    QP --> CH1[Push]
    QP --> CH2[Email]
    QP --> CH3[In-app inbox]
    CH1 & CH2 --> ST[Delivery status → feedback loop]
